* **API reference** – https://maplibre.org/maplibre-gl-js/docs/API/
* **Migration guide (official)** – https://maplibre.org/maplibre-gl-js/docs/guides/mapbox-migration-guide/
* **Style editor** – Use **Maputnik** (https://maputnik.github.io/) to edit your style JSON and see the `sky` block in the UI.
